OL,3,GNEWSATwo children who were struck by
OL,4,Acar leave hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo children who were injured when they
OL,7,Fwere struck by a car in East Sussex
OL,8,Fhave been released from hospital,
OL,9,Fpolice say.
OL,11,FThe children, aged six and three, were
OL,12,Ftaken along with a 42-year-old man -
OL,13,Fwho was seriously hurt and remained in
OL,14,Fhospital - following the crash at about
OL,15,F08:30 GMT on Wednesday, on the B2240 at
OL,16,FThe Stream, Catsfield.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
