OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATwo children who were struck by
OL,4,Acar leave hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 72-year-old man arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof causing serious injury by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving and driving while unfit through
OL,9,Fdrink or drugs has been bailed while
OL,10,Finquiries continued, Sussex Police
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe road has now reopened after it was
OL,14,Fclosed while an investigation was
OL,15,Fcarried out at the scene.
